รรับสมัครงาน         รับสมัครงานผ่านทาง JOBBKK.COM         hr_213610_1206464@applywork.jobbkk.com                         สมัครงานด่วน             สมัครด้วยเรซูเม่รูปแบบเต็ม จากระบบสมาชิก JOBBKK                 สร้างเรซูเม่แบบย่อ             สมัครง่ายและรวดเร็ว ด้วยการกรอกข้อมูลแบบย่อ                 แนบไฟล์สมัคร             สมัครด้วยการแนบไฟล์เรซูเม่ หรือ ผลงานของท่าน                        สมัครงานผ่านอีเมล       คลิกที่นี่เพื่อดูวิธีการใช้งานสมัครด้วยอีเมล                   สมัครผ่านอีเมล (แนบไฟล์ผ่านอีเมลได้ไฟล์ละไม่เกิน 10 MB จำกัด 3 ไฟล์)       หมายเหตุ : เฉพาะไฟล์ *.jpg, *.jpeg, *.png หรือ *.doc, *.docx, *.pdf','งานประจำ','2026-02-19 11:43:33.741','20,000 - 25,000 THB a month',0),('2eea31c8-349b-4f80-b623-4c2e6dbee321','9b0f603e-64a5-4346-845c-27c45e72b4ca','https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/chef-de-cuisine-the-verandah-at-mandarin-oriental-4436751469?_l=en','Chef de Cuisine - The Verandah','Mandarin Oriental','Bangkok, Bangkok City, Thailand','Mandarin Oriental, Bangkok is looking for a Chef de Cuisine - The Verandah to join our Food Preparation Department team. Are you a master of craft? Do you thrive in a team that succeeds together, demonstrating integrity and respect while acting responsibly? Do you embrace a growth mindset? We invite you to become a fan of the exceptional. Mandarin Oriental Hotel Group is the award-winning owner and operator of some of the most luxurious hotels, resorts and residences located in prime destinations around the world, with a strong development pipeline. Increasingly recognised for creating some of the world’s most sought-after properties, the Group provides legendary service inspired by Asian heritage whilst representing the very cutting-edge of luxury experiences. Mandarin Oriental, Bangkok – For over 150 years, this legendary riverside hotel has welcomed travelers seeking exceptional luxury, style and service. The renovated River Wing enhances our iconic Thai-inspired elegance and resort-like serenity. About The Job Based at Mandarin Oriental, Bangkok, dining is more than a meal, it’s a story, a mood and a moment. Verandah is our all-day dining destination where modern culinary craftsmanship meets relaxed elegance, celebrating fresh ingredients, bold flavors and vibrant hospitality. We are seeking a passionate and brand-driven Chef de Cuisine to lead Verandah into its next chapter. As Chef de Cuisine, you are the creative and operational leader of Verandah’s kitchen, bringing the brand vision to life through food that is consistent and inspiring. You will shape menus, develop talent and ensure every plate reflects our commitment to quality, experience and innovation. Responsibilities Brand & Culinary Leadership Translate the Verandah and MOBKK brand identity into a compelling culinary offering Design and evolve seasonal, trend-aware menus that balance creativity with commercial success Deliver a guest experience that is memorable, consistent and on brand Kitchen Operations Lead day-to-day kitchen operations with a focus on quality, efficiency and consistency Maintain exceptional standards in food safety, hygiene and compliance Manage cost controls including food cost, wastage and inventory People & Culture Build, mentor and inspire a high-performing kitchen team Foster a culture aligned with MOBKK values. Identify and develop future culinary talent Collaboration & Innovation Work closely with Front of House, Marketing and Leadership teams to deliver cohesive guest experiences Contribute to brand storytelling through activations, promotions and events Stay ahead of industry trends, bringing fresh ideas to the table As Chef De Cuisine, We Expect You To Have Proven experience as a Chef de Cuisine or Senior Sous Chef in a high-volume, lifestyle-driven dining environment A brand-led mindset, understand how food shapes identity and guest perception Strong leadership and coaching skills with a passion for developing teams Commercial acumen with experience managing budgets and kitchen performance Creative, hands-on, and detail-oriented with a commitment to excellence Our commitment to you Learning & Development. Your success is our success. We craft unique learning and development programmes for various stages in your career so that you grow, continuously. MOstay. When you work as hard as our colleagues do, it’s important to take time off. As a member of the #MOfamily, you can stay with us wherever you go in the world. The MOstay programme offers complimentary nights and additionally attractive rates on rooms for you and your loved ones. Heath & Colleague Wellness. Finding the right work-life balance is important. Your wellbeing matters to us. A variety of health benefits and wellness programmes are offered to all our colleagues, globally. Retirement Plans. When you show commitment to us, we reciprocate. We offer different retirement plans depending on the length of your service and your role. Medical Benefits and Group Insurance Hotel Gym We’re Fans. Are you? Show more Show less','Full-time','2026-07-26 08:18:37.543',NULL,0),('46fb3863-224c-46b7-9559-42e0061d02ed','33830f11-29ae-4317-a604-d80136e4cdc3','https://th.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=ffa9888243fe35d1','Software Developer','CrossingSoft','จอมทอง, กรุงเทพฯ','คุณสมบัติ \n วุฒิปริญญาตรี สาขา Computer Science, Computer Engineering, หรืออื่น ๆ ที่เกี่ยวข้อง (รับพิจารณานักศึกษาจบใหม่) \n มีประสบการณ์ 0-3 ปี \n มีความสนใจที่จะทำงานใน DevOps Culture \n มีความรู้ความเข้าใจเกี่ยวกับ Client-Server Web Application และ Architecture \n มีความรู้ความเข้าใจเกี่ยวกับ JavaScript / HTML / CSS \nมีประสบการณ์ในด้าน Frontend Framework หรือ Library (ex: Angular, React, Vue) \nมีประสบการณ์ในด้าน Backend Framework (ex: Spring boot (Java), .Net Core (C#), Golang, Nest.js) \n มีความสามารถในการทำงานเป็นทีม มีทัศนคติที่ดี และกระตือรือร้นที่จะเรียนรู้ในสิ่งใหม่ ๆ \n หน้าที่ \n ออกแบบและพัฒนา Web/mobile application จาก Figma / Adobe XD Design \n ออกแบบและพัฒนา Web API/Web Service ตาม requirements \n ประสานงานกับทีมออกแบบเพื่อรับประกันคุณภาพของการทำงาน \n ตรวจสอบโค้ดต้นฉบับ \n รับประกันคุณภาพของงานให้ตรงตามความต้องการของลูกค้าก่อนที่จะส่งไปให้ทีมทดสอบ \n ออกแบบ database สำหรับ Web Application system \n มีความเข้าใจและให้การสนับสนุนเมื่อพบปัญหาหรือข้อผิดพลาด \n รวบรวมและวิเคราะห์ข้อมูลเพื่อระบุและแก้ไขปัญหา พร้อมทั้งป้องกันความล้มเหลวในอนาคต \n ส่งมอบงานให้เสร็จตรงตามเวลา \n มีแรงจูงใจและกระตือรือร้นที่จะพัฒนาทั้งตนเองและทีมงาน',NULL,'2026-02-28 17:41:59.906',NULL,0),('48d5b7b4-765e-4c7e-a0a0-8a7754ec67e8','9b0f603e-64a5-4346-845c-27c45e72b4ca','https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/demi-chef-de-partie-cafe%4022-at-marriott-international-4430944858?_l=en','Demi Chef de Partie - Cafe@22','Marriott International','Bangkok, Bangkok City, Thailand','Additional Information Job Number 26075067 Job Category Food and Beverage & Culinary Location 199 Sukhumvit Soi 22, Bangkok, Bangkok, Thailand, 10110 VIEW ON MAP Schedule Full Time Located Remotely? N Position Type Non-Management Position Summary Supervise and coordinate activities of cooks and workers. Determine how food should be presented and create decorative food displays. Ensure proper portion, arrangement, and food garnish to be served. Monitor the quantity of food that is prepared. Inform Food & Beverage service staff of menu specials and out of stock menu items. Prepare special meals or substitute items. Assist cooks and kitchen staff with various tasks. Provide cooks with needed items. Monitor stock of kitchen supplies and food. Maintain kitchen logs for food safety program and food products. Ensure the quality of the food items and notify manager if a product does not meet specifications. Assist management in hiring, training, scheduling, evaluating, counseling, disciplining, and motivating and coaching employees. Follow all company and safety and security policies and procedures; report maintenance needs, accidents, injuries, and unsafe work conditions to manager; complete safety training and certifications. Ensure uniform and personal appearance are clean and professional; maintain confidentiality of proprietary information; protect company assets. Address guests’ service needs. Speak with others using clear and professional language. Develop and maintain positive working relationships with others; support team to reach common goals; listen and respond appropriately to the concerns of other employees. Ensure adherence to quality expectations and standards. Stand, sit, or walk for an extended period of time. Reach overhead and below the knees, including bending, twisting, pulling, and stooping. Move, lift, carry, push, pull, and place objects weighing less than or equal to 25 pounds without assistance. Perform other reasonable job duties as requested by Supervisors. Preferred Qualification Education: Technical, Trade, or Vocational School Degree. Related Work Experience: 4 to 6 years of related work experience. Supervisory Experience: At least 2 years of supervisory experience. License or Certification: None At Marriott International, we are dedicated to being an equal opportunity employer, welcoming all and providing access to opportunity. We actively foster an environment where the unique backgrounds of our associates are valued and celebrated. Our greatest strength lies in the rich blend of culture, talent, and experiences of our associates. We are committed to non-discrimination on any protected basis, including disability, veteran status, or other basis protected by applicable law. Marriott Hotels strive to elevate the art of hospitality, innovating at every opportunity while keeping the comfort of the oh-so-familiar all around the globe. As a host with Marriott Hotels, you will help keep the promise of “Wonderful Hospitality. Always.” by delivering thoughtful, heartfelt, forward-thinking service that upholds and builds upon this living legacy. With the name that’s synonymous with hospitality the world over, we are proud to welcome you to explore a career with Marriott Hotels. In joining Marriott Hotels, you join a portfolio of brands with Marriott International. Be where you can do your best work, begin your purpose, belong to an amazing global team, and become the best version of you. JW Marriott is part of Marriott International\'s luxury portfolio and consists of more than 100 beautiful properties in gateway cities and distinctive resort locations around the world. JW believes our associates come first. Because if you’re happy, our guests will be happy. JW Marriott associates are confident, innovative, genuine, intuitive, and carry on the legacy of the brand’s namesake and company founder, J.Willard Marriott. Our hotels offer a work experience unlike any other, where you’ll be part of a community and enjoy true camaraderie with a diverse group of co-workers. JW creates opportunities for training, development, recognition and most importantly, a place where you can pursue your passions in a luxury environment with a focus on holistic well-being. Treating guests exceptionally starts with the way we take care of our associates. That’s The JW Treatment™. In joining JW Marriott, you join a portfolio of brands with Marriott International. Be where you can do your best work, begin your purpose, belong to an amazing global team, and become the best version of you. Show more Show less','Full-time','2026-07-31 15:16:41.613',NULL,0),('4f64accf-801d-4ef8-8623-ce5e6bd105ba','33830f11-29ae-4317-a604-d80136e4cdc3','https://th.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=c4a2c3d4fafa58c9','.NET Developer','ORCSOFT Company','กรุงเทพฯ','We offer a competitive salary and benefit package including bonus, health insurance, travelling expense, allowance, training, and annual leave.   Interested candidates should send resume, transcripts, and expected salary to the e-mail: hr@orcsoft.co.th Qualification :-   Bachelor’s Degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering or related fields  At least 1 year working experience in .NET/C# development field  Enjoy working in a team environment  Responsible, fast learner and able to meet a deadline  Experience in Javascript technologies such as Angular, React is a plus  Responsible, fast learner and able to meet a deadline  Good in problem analyze and trouble shooting',NULL,'2026-02-26 22:25:49.181',NULL,0),('5a92d30f-309a-4a94-8f45-a28525505ef4','9b0f603e-64a5-4346-845c-27c45e72b4ca','https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/italian-chef-at-amari-don-muang-airport-bangkok-4436060642?_l=en','Italian Chef','Amari Don Muang Airport Bangkok','Bangkok, Bangkok City, Thailand','Job Summary: Administer the entire culinary operation in such a manner as to bring into effect the superior product and service expected for our guests in accordance with policies and procedures adopted by the Hotel. Main Duties & Responsibilities Responsible for the overall operation of the Italian Kitchen and ensuring smooth day-to-day operations. Develop, maintain, and continuously improve authentic Italian menus, recipes, and culinary concepts. Ensure all food is prepared and presented according to established quality standards and recipes. Monitor food quality, portion control, and consistency to maximize guest satisfaction. Control food cost through proper purchasing, receiving, storage, production, and inventory management. Ensure compliance with food safety, hygiene, sanitation, and HACCP standards. Conduct regular inspections of kitchen cleanliness, equipment, and food storage areas. Supervise and coordinate all kitchen Team Member within the Italian Restaurant. Train, mentor, and develop culinary team members to enhance their skills and performance. Prepare Team Member schedules according to business volume and operational requirements Assist in the preparation of annual budgets, forecasts, and monthly cost analysis reports. Monitor labor costs and productivity to ensure operational efficiency. Maintain accurate inventory levels and conduct monthly stock-taking. Work closely with Purchasing and Receiving departments to ensure quality ingredients are sourced. Collaborate with Restaurant Management to create seasonal menus, promotions, and special events. Handle guest feedback and complaints professionally and take corrective action when required. Ensure all kitchen equipment is properly maintained and report repair requirements promptly. Maintain a safe working environment and ensure compliance with all health and safety regulations. Promote teamwork and effective communication within the kitchen and across departments. Lead by example and foster a positive and productive work environment. Perform any other duties assigned by the Director, Culinary or Management. Show more Show less','Full-time','2026-07-11 08:18:39.834',NULL,0),('5c133c3e-4cf0-4820-bc3e-b1a3a2efd41e','9b0f603e-64a5-4346-845c-27c45e72b4ca','https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/chef-de-partie-at-%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%A9%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%97-%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%93%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1-%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B3%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94-3922501085?_l=en','Chef de Partie','บริษัท พิณสยาม จำกัด','Bangkok, Bangkok City, Thailand','รายละเอียดงาน สามารถทำอาหารตามสูตรของห้องอาหารที่กำหนดได้ ทำงานเป็นทีมและมีความคิดริเริ่มสร้างสรรค์ดี สามารถคิดสูตรเมนูได้ มีเซอร์วิส 2 ชนิด ของห้องอาหารการันตี 1,000 ขึ้นไป ของโรงแรมการันตี 800 ขึ้นไป มีเงินทิปตามยอดขายของร้าน อาหารฟรี 3 มื้อ และอื่นๆ กรณีพูดภาษาอังกฤษได้ จะมีเงินค่าภาษา จังหวัด กรุงเทพมหานคร อัตราที่รับ 4 อัตรา เงินเดือน 17,000 ขึ้นไป บาท คุณสมบัติผู้สมัคร ไม่จำกัดเพศ อายุไม่เกิน 50 ปี ไม่จำกัดวุฒิการศึกษา มีประสบการณ์ในด้านงานครัวของร้านอาหารหรือโรงแรม จะพิจารณาเป็นพิเศษ มีความขยันอดทนและมีความรับผิดชอบต่อหน้าที่ สามารถเลือกสาขาที่ปฏิบัติงานได้ ติดต่อ ฝ่ายทรัพยากรบุคคล สวัสดิการ เงินช่วยเหลือการบวช, แต่งงาน, งานศพ เงิน SERVICE ประจำเดือน การันตรี 1000 ขึ้นไปต่อเดือน พนักงานหน้าร้าน เงิน TIPS ประจำเดือน พนักงานหน้าร้าน กองทุนประกันสังคม / กองทุนเงินทดแทน พนักงานส่วนสำนักงาน ทำงาน จันทร์-ศุกร์ หอพักบา่งตำแหน่ง อาหารกลางวัน เงินพิเศษ/เบี้ยขยัน โบนัสประจำปีตามผลประกอบการ วิธีการสมัคร 